<title>USA: Southwest Gas stake upped by Gabelli group.</title>
<headline>Southwest Gas stake upped by Gabelli group.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by New York investment manager Mario Gabelli said Thursday it raised its stake in Southwest Gas Corp to 1,918,300 common shares or 7.13 percent from 6.02 percent previously held.</p>
<p>In a filing with the Securities and Exchange Commission, the group said its latest transactions took place between May 28 and June 10 at prices ranging from $16.30 to $18.50 per share.</p>
<p>Southwest, based in Las Vegas, is a diversifed natural gas utility and financial services organization.</p>
</text>
